# THE CHRONICLES — Netlify redirects
# One official address: the site's own Netlify subdomain forwards every page,
# with its path, query and #section, to thechronicles.live (301 = permanent,
# ! = even though the file exists). Deploy previews use other addresses and
# are not affected. www.thechronicles.live is forwarded by Netlify itself,
# because thechronicles.live is set as the primary domain.
http://thechronicleslive.netlify.app/*   https://thechronicles.live/:splat   301!
https://thechronicleslive.netlify.app/*  https://thechronicles.live/:splat   301!
